st mentioned  uh established molecular prognostic  lesions as well as  genes that capture the functional  orientation of the immunological tumor  micro environment so  i really look forward to the  translational  elements of this research  fantastic and then finally are there  other genetic drivers of cancer  associated with a hot tumor  microenvironment  so yes in our study we have identified  rank 1  mutations as being associated with a hot  tumor micro environment and  again ranks 1 mutations correlate with  poor clinical outcomes in email  and there is evidence published by  others in solid tumors and specifically  in lung cancer  that k-ras and n-grass mutations may be  associated with a hot  tumor mark environment  great thank you so much i really enjoyed  your talk and really appreciate you  sharing your research with us this is  fantastic  thank you very much
 

